---
permalink: "{{ permalinkPath }}"
permalinkPath: en/departement-var.html
altLangUrl: "departement-var"
lang: "en"
layout: base.njk
title: "Travelling with your dog in the Var (83) | Coco Explore"
description: "Beaches, walks, restaurants, accommodation and vets that welcome dogs in the Var department, French Riviera."
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom: 2rem;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <span class="kicker">Explore by area</span>
      <h1>Travelling with your dog in the Var</h1>
      <p>A first English-language selection of dog-friendly spots in the Var department, on the French Riviera. We're translating this department one listing at a time — <a href="/departement-var">see the full French page</a> for the complete, up-to-date list (131+ listings).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- set varFichesEn = collections.fichesEn | byCategoryAndDept(["cote-azur", "plages", "lacs", "hebergements", "balades", "restaurants", "veterinaires", "toiletteurs", "dogwash", "dogsitters", "activites"], "83") %}
<section class="fiches wrap" id="var-en-listings">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Translated so far</span>
    <h2>{{ varFichesEn.length }} listing{{ "s" if varFichesEn.length != 1 else "" }} available in English</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="fiche-grid">
    {%- for fiche in varFichesEn %}
    <a href="/{{ fiche.data.permalinkPath | cleanUrl }}" class="fiche-card">
      <div class="thumb">
        {%- set cardSrcset = fiche.data.heroImage | imgSrcset %}
        <img src="{{ fiche.data.heroImage | optimizeImg | safe }}"{% if cardSrcset %} srcset="{{ cardSrcset | safe }}" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 380px"{% endif %} alt="{{ fiche.data.cardTitle | safe }} — {{ fiche.data.cardTag | safe }}" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <span class="tag">{{ fiche.data.cardTag | safe }}</span>
        <h3>{{ fiche.data.cardTitle | safe }}</h3>
        <p>{{ fiche.data.cardTeaser | safe }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" style="padding: 1rem 0 3rem;">
  <p style="color: rgba(34,48,58,0.7); font-size: 0.95rem;">Looking for the rest of France? For now, the rest of the site — <a href="/">all 101 departments, ~9,300 listings</a> — is in French only. Use your browser's translation feature, or come back soon as we add more English pages.</p>
</section>
